      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LEAP OF LOGIC (1) drew wide and was forced to work when racing deep but still scored a decisive win last time out at this circuit and distance, getting home by 11 metres in a dominant display. Has the benefit of the inside draw and is lightly raced with upside so could go on with it. VILLAROCK (7) has not raced for eight months but went to the paddock in fine form, winning his last three outings. Must overcome a wide draw but looks forward enough for the return after three trials, recording a minor placing in the latest. HAYCHARLI (10) draws on the back line but is worth plenty of thought off a last-start win by a nose at this circuit and distance. UNCLE CRAIGO (2) won the last time he started on the front row so look for improvement.",
